---
// PromoServices component to cross-promote custom consulting/development on Suite pages
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-meg-bg-dark border-t border-meg-border-dark relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glow Overlay -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-emerald-500/5 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl relative z-10">
    <div class="relative group">
      <!-- Glow border effect -->
      <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/20 rounded-3xl blur opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-700" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      
      <div class="relative bg-meg-surface-dark/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-meg-border-dark p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl meg-glass grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Text content (col-span-8) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 text-center lg:text-left">
          <span class="gsap-fadein text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench text-xs"></i>
            Custom Integrationen & Consulting
          </span>
          <h3 class="gsap-fadein text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-meg-text-primary-dark tracking-tight mb-4">
            Sie benötigen <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-teal-400">Anpassungen?</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gsap-fadein text-base text-meg-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Die Waldheim Suite deckt 90% Ihrer Standard-Prozesse ab. Sie benötigen jedoch eine spezielle ERP-Schnittstelle, die Migration Ihrer historischen Altdaten, ein individuelles CRM-Dashboard oder Mitarbeiter-Schulungen? Als erfahrener **Senior Software Architect & DevSecOps Consultant** passe ich die Suite exakt an Ihre B2B-Infrastruktur an.
          </p>
          <div class="gsap-fadein flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-meg-text-secondary">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Legacy Migration (SQL, Excel)</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Custom Schnittstellen & APIs</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> CI/CD Pipeline Integration</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action (col-span-4) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-4 w-full justify-center">
          <a
            href="/services/entwicklung/"
            class="gsap-fadein w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-emerald-500/35 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
            Entwicklungs-Services
          </a>
          <a
            href="/kontakt/"
            class="gsap-fadein w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl bg-meg-surface-dark border border-meg-border-dark text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-meg-surface-dark/80 transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i>
            Audit anfragen
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
